# House Hlaalu: Crassius Curio's work, Vivec.
# "Velfred the Outlaw" (HH_NordSmugglers): the Nord smuggler on the Bitter Coast agrees to pay House Hlaalu its
# respects at disposition 75 ("respect House Hlaalu": 50; SetDisposition stands in for persuasion); Crassius pays
# (100).
# Position + `approach` stand in for the travel.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance --instance 2 mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_a1_11_report --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case hh_nord_smugglers
run
player->PositionCell 492 -116 -491 0 "Vivec, Curio Manor"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, Curio Manor" == 1
approach 059264AE
talk crassius curio
ask business
ask Velfred the Outlaw
expect GetJournalIndex HH_NordSmugglers == 10
bye
run
player->Position -54732 -44843 178 0
until 300 player->GetDistance velfred < 2000
approach 058E1FE7
run
velfred->SetDisposition 100
talk velfred
ask respect House Hlaalu
expect GetJournalIndex HH_NordSmugglers == 50
bye
run
player->PositionCell 492 -116 -491 0 "Vivec, Curio Manor"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, Curio Manor" == 1
approach 059264AE
talk crassius curio
ask Velfred the Outlaw
expect GetJournalIndex HH_NordSmugglers == 100
bye
end
